WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.380 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 7]

01:41.230 --> 01:42.330
Please wield the Dormant Dragon Sword

01:42.710 --> 01:44.020
and inherit the title of Patriarch.

01:53.710 --> 01:56.180
Lord Kui, please wield the Dormant Dragon Sword

01:56.350 --> 01:58.210
and inherit the title of Patriarch.

02:01.150 --> 02:01.900
All, rise.

02:20.080 --> 02:20.850
I promise you.

02:23.000 --> 02:24.010
When this is over,

02:25.680 --> 02:26.940
I will take you home,

02:29.630 --> 02:30.170
with honor

02:31.840 --> 02:33.260
and in freedom.

02:56.120 --> 02:56.500
Sir.

03:19.080 --> 03:19.570
Sir,

03:21.000 --> 03:21.850
Senior Fanhua

03:22.590 --> 03:24.170
was killed by the Su family

03:25.310 --> 03:26.450
while seizing the Dormant Dragon Sword.

03:28.030 --> 03:28.740
In the days after,

03:28.740 --> 03:30.410
Senior Jinke, who was to receive him,

03:31.150 --> 03:32.010
was ambushed,

03:33.120 --> 03:33.890
no remains found.

03:35.000 --> 03:35.890
Fanhua,

03:36.630 --> 03:37.780
your health was poor,

03:38.400 --> 03:39.170
so no wine for you,

03:39.520 --> 03:40.450
only tea.

03:42.470 --> 03:42.980
You even said

03:43.000 --> 03:45.140
tea would help you live longer.

03:47.000 --> 03:48.540
But I told you,

03:50.030 --> 03:51.380
We're assassins.

03:51.750 --> 03:53.260
We dance with death.

03:54.280 --> 03:55.760
If fun lasts a day,

03:57.280 --> 03:58.780
we make it count.

04:03.030 --> 04:04.290
My condolences, Sir.

04:07.860 --> 04:11.420
[Xie Ba, head of the Xie family]

04:24.950 --> 04:26.780
Where is Xie Qidao's disciple?

04:27.240 --> 04:28.810
Xie Buxie lost to Su Muyu,

04:29.800 --> 04:30.490
and then...

04:32.360 --> 04:33.100
went missing.

04:33.560 --> 04:34.810
No trace since?

04:35.310 --> 04:36.540
You mean

04:37.270 --> 04:39.050
Xie Buxie defected?

04:40.310 --> 04:40.980
I dare not say that.

04:41.800 --> 04:42.540
In Blood River,

04:42.830 --> 04:45.170
there is no "missing".

04:45.920 --> 04:47.460
If he left without leave,

04:47.560 --> 04:48.730
that is desertion!

04:49.270 --> 04:50.540
Send two men to find him.

04:51.120 --> 04:51.610
Also,

04:52.310 --> 04:54.930
send word to Xie Qidao

04:55.720 --> 04:56.580
to come

04:57.310 --> 04:58.250
to Jiuxiao City.

04:59.070 --> 04:59.730
Regarding Uncle Qidao...

05:01.000 --> 05:02.220
I visited him before,

05:02.360 --> 05:02.850
but...

05:03.240 --> 05:04.250
he drove me out.

05:06.870 --> 05:09.020
Everything has a price.

05:09.430 --> 05:11.460
If he wants to shield

05:11.590 --> 05:12.380
his disciple,

05:12.800 --> 05:15.330
he will pay for it!

05:16.750 --> 05:18.080
Blood River

05:18.080 --> 05:19.730
is not some martial sect.

05:20.000 --> 05:23.100
He doesn't get to shut in and train!

05:23.870 --> 05:24.640
And now...

05:27.680 --> 05:29.220
Who allowed you to stand?

05:32.630 --> 05:33.460
On your knees.

05:34.510 --> 05:35.730
Kneel three days straight!

05:50.190 --> 05:50.810
Sir.

06:11.000 --> 06:11.780
Who killed him?

06:14.120 --> 06:14.580
The Su family.

06:15.870 --> 06:16.290
Su Zhe.

06:18.720 --> 06:20.070
His gold ring

06:20.630 --> 06:22.400
would cause wounds like this.

06:24.360 --> 06:25.050
The Su family

06:25.600 --> 06:27.500
actually sent that monster.

06:32.870 --> 06:33.700
They all stand

06:33.720 --> 06:34.790
with the Patriarch?

06:35.800 --> 06:36.610
Likely not.

06:37.560 --> 06:39.260
He showed up

06:39.800 --> 06:40.640
to kill the miracle physician

06:40.640 --> 06:41.520
of Medicine King Valley,

06:41.690 --> 06:42.800
but for some reason

06:43.240 --> 06:44.490
he suddenly killed our men.

06:45.560 --> 06:46.410
I fought with my life

06:46.870 --> 06:47.980
to bring back the young master's body.

06:53.750 --> 06:54.460
Rise, all of you.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.490
In Blood River, we live on the edge.

06:57.510 --> 06:58.370
That's the way of things.

06:59.310 --> 07:00.900
Even if the dead is my son,

07:02.000 --> 07:03.460
you need not mourn!

07:10.390 --> 07:10.930
Who's coming?

07:16.830 --> 07:17.490
The Death Coffin?

07:18.120 --> 07:19.140
Locked inside The Death Coffin

07:19.680 --> 07:20.460
is that madman.

07:21.950 --> 07:22.340
Sir,

07:22.630 --> 07:23.610
you must not open this coffin.

07:23.750 --> 07:24.370
It's far too dangerous!

07:25.040 --> 07:25.610
The Death Coffin

07:26.040 --> 07:27.100
has been under the watch of the Soul Reapers' Hall.

07:27.720 --> 07:29.540
Why is it here?

07:29.950 --> 07:31.410
I requested it from the Soul Reapers' Hall.

07:32.800 --> 07:33.810
Since they agreed to lend it,

07:34.510 --> 07:35.850
it shows their loyalty lies

07:36.310 --> 07:37.460
with our Mu family.

08:00.800 --> 08:02.290
Ah, Changhe...

08:03.160 --> 08:05.490
either you don't act at all,

08:05.870 --> 08:06.540
or when you do,

08:07.430 --> 08:10.660
you plunge Blood River into chaos.

08:13.270 --> 08:13.980
Master,

08:14.560 --> 08:15.900
stop mocking me.

08:17.070 --> 08:18.060
Look at me.

08:18.060 --> 08:19.300
Mu Zizhe beat me to a pulp.

08:20.560 --> 08:22.100
I'm not as tough as you claim.

08:23.240 --> 08:24.850
Xie Fanhua is dead,

08:25.430 --> 08:27.140
you know that, right?

08:29.950 --> 08:30.780
I killed him.

08:31.360 --> 08:32.460
That guy

08:32.550 --> 08:33.100
was already

08:33.120 --> 08:34.010
half dead anyway.

08:34.480 --> 08:35.340
The Xie family

08:35.440 --> 08:36.870
had long wished him dead.

08:37.480 --> 08:38.180
Without his death,

08:38.550 --> 08:39.360
those younger ones

08:39.360 --> 08:40.400
couldn't step into view.

08:41.630 --> 08:44.010
If Xie Fanhua were healthy,

08:44.750 --> 08:45.890
there's no doubt

08:46.480 --> 08:49.370
he'd be the Xie family's next head.

08:50.390 --> 08:51.490
You killed him,

08:51.960 --> 08:54.010
that's on your record.

08:55.790 --> 08:56.850
But killing Mu Bai...

08:58.030 --> 08:59.490
you went too far.

09:00.630 --> 09:01.100
What?

09:02.030 --> 09:02.980
Mu Bai is dead too?

09:04.200 --> 09:05.020
Who did it?

09:07.910 --> 09:09.010
You don't know?

09:10.840 --> 09:11.700
Su Zhe.

09:12.150 --> 09:13.180
Who sent him?

09:17.200 --> 09:17.850
We're doomed.

09:18.870 --> 09:20.220
Uncle Zhe's usually

09:20.240 --> 09:21.650
the laziest of us,

09:22.480 --> 09:23.770
why so eager this time?

09:24.790 --> 09:25.650
Since he killed Mu Bai,

09:25.670 --> 09:26.910
if I run into Mu Zizhe again,

09:28.030 --> 09:29.310
he'll skin me alive!

09:29.840 --> 09:31.920
Mu Zizhe is a madman.

09:32.670 --> 09:34.740
Now you've killed his son,

09:34.910 --> 09:36.640
he won't just skin you,

09:36.720 --> 09:37.690
he'll skin

09:37.690 --> 09:39.740
the whole Su family.

09:40.960 --> 09:42.490
For the past hundred years,

09:43.630 --> 09:45.530
Blood River had its infighting.

09:46.080 --> 09:48.300
But the standoff among the Three Families

09:48.960 --> 09:50.130
never changed.

09:52.550 --> 09:53.730
This time

09:54.910 --> 09:56.890
may be different.

10:02.320 --> 10:02.850
Master,

10:03.440 --> 10:04.460
this really isn't on me.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.820
Uncle Zhe did it himself.

10:06.480 --> 10:07.060
I sent him to kill

10:07.080 --> 10:07.940
the miracle physician,

10:07.960 --> 10:08.820
not Mu Bai.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.100
Enough.

10:13.440 --> 10:15.010
What's done is done.

10:16.080 --> 10:17.250
Since that's the case,

10:18.670 --> 10:19.610
we may as well

10:20.480 --> 10:23.060
make all Blood River bear the name Su.

10:29.200 --> 10:30.370
Master, you're bold and brilliant.

10:31.320 --> 10:32.230
I, Su Changhe,

10:32.390 --> 10:33.510
will follow you to the death!

10:34.840 --> 10:36.800
You'll die for me,

10:37.440 --> 10:38.720
but what about Su Zhe?

10:46.750 --> 10:47.370
Uncle Zhe...

10:48.080 --> 10:48.610
what about him?

10:50.750 --> 10:52.130
Master feared Mu Zizhe's revenge,

10:52.670 --> 10:54.010
so he just sent a unit

10:54.010 --> 10:55.120
to reinforce Su Zhe.

10:55.480 --> 10:56.530
But they found

10:56.910 --> 10:58.690
Su Zhe didn't fight Su Muyu,

10:59.270 --> 11:00.560
instead he chose to travel with Su Muyu

11:00.600 --> 11:02.340
and that miracle physician

11:02.630 --> 11:03.420
back to the Spider's Nest.

11:12.910 --> 11:14.220
So Su Muyu turned Uncle Zhe

11:15.550 --> 11:16.490
to his side?

11:24.080 --> 11:24.490
Master.

11:26.390 --> 11:27.220
Just now...

11:28.080 --> 11:28.730
Buxie came back.

11:29.820 --> 11:33.420
[Xie Qidao of the Xie family]

11:34.270 --> 11:35.010
He's back?

11:39.030 --> 11:39.980
The task is done?

11:41.030 --> 11:42.220
He said nothing about it,

11:43.440 --> 11:44.370
just left this.

11:55.910 --> 11:58.060
He fought Su Muyu.

11:59.910 --> 12:01.940
This is the eighth move he mastered?

12:02.640 --> 12:03.510
Buxie said

12:03.720 --> 12:05.250
this still isn't the true eighth move.

12:06.000 --> 12:07.610
He needs a few more years to roam.

12:08.080 --> 12:09.340
He'll return once he finds the answer.

12:15.000 --> 12:16.010
He's mad.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.420
In Blood River,

12:19.200 --> 12:20.810
if one goes roaming the martial world

12:21.550 --> 12:22.870
and stays out over ten days,

12:23.510 --> 12:25.280
the Soul Reapers' Hall's kill writ

12:25.280 --> 12:26.540
will be issued

12:26.540 --> 12:27.460
without hesitation.

12:28.440 --> 12:29.700
That's the second matter.

12:30.670 --> 12:31.420
We received a letter from the family head.

12:35.390 --> 12:36.490
What does it say?

12:37.440 --> 12:38.580
I can't bother reading

12:39.120 --> 12:39.730
their usual nonsense.

12:40.510 --> 12:41.700
Just tell me straight.

12:42.240 --> 12:42.890
The head says,

12:43.240 --> 12:44.370
Xie Buxie's ignored the mission

12:45.030 --> 12:45.820
and left Blood River without leave,

12:46.120 --> 12:46.730
a capital offense.

12:47.480 --> 12:48.850
But if you will come out

12:49.320 --> 12:50.060
to Jiuxiao City

12:50.240 --> 12:51.130
and aid the Xie family,

12:51.870 --> 12:53.060
they'll ask the Soul Reapers' Hall

12:53.360 --> 12:54.130
for a writ

12:54.840 --> 12:56.060
pardoning Xie Buxie.

13:00.510 --> 13:01.610
Xie Ba...

13:03.960 --> 13:06.820
is quite the schemer.

13:08.020 --> 13:11.940
[Luojiuxiao Inn]

13:16.480 --> 13:16.980
Medicine time.

13:19.080 --> 13:19.580
Feed me.

13:20.270 --> 13:20.610
Hey...

13:20.960 --> 13:21.490
What?

13:23.870 --> 13:25.650
Shouldn't you feed me

13:25.670 --> 13:26.180
after you hurt me?

13:27.030 --> 13:28.340
I'm not clinging to you for life anyway.

13:28.440 --> 13:29.340
Count yourself lucky.

14:00.390 --> 14:01.770
Such a thoughtful young lord.

14:03.630 --> 14:04.530
Stalling me with this trick

14:04.840 --> 14:05.820
isn't a good idea.

14:07.870 --> 14:09.100
Your wounds will heal,

14:09.790 --> 14:10.250
and I...

14:11.080 --> 14:12.460
will seek the Patriarch

14:13.390 --> 14:14.420
to avenge Second Master Tang.

14:26.150 --> 14:27.250
Bitter medicine.

14:29.200 --> 14:30.420
Then wait till I'm healed,

14:30.480 --> 14:31.100
and we'll talk.

14:31.960 --> 14:33.340
After all, a Xuanwu Guardian

14:33.870 --> 14:35.010
should pay his debt first,

14:35.390 --> 14:36.130
then seek revenge.

14:44.750 --> 14:45.250
Uncle Zhe.

14:49.870 --> 14:51.010
That noise you made yesterday

14:51.030 --> 14:52.220
was way too loud.

14:52.600 --> 14:53.460
I heard it all.

14:54.200 --> 14:55.700
Do you really want to be Patriarch?

14:57.550 --> 14:58.250
You think I'm fit for it?

14:58.790 --> 14:59.370
No.

15:00.910 --> 15:01.700
If my daughter

15:01.790 --> 15:02.650
takes a shine to you,

15:03.150 --> 15:03.850
absolutely not.

15:05.550 --> 15:06.700
If she doesn't,

15:07.270 --> 15:07.890
then maybe.

15:12.600 --> 15:13.460
You jest, Uncle Zhe.

15:16.120 --> 15:17.460
News came from outside

15:18.390 --> 15:19.370
that Xie Fanhua is dead.

15:20.720 --> 15:21.580
Changhe killed him.

15:23.200 --> 15:24.130
Mu Bai is dead too.

15:25.120 --> 15:25.700
I killed him.

15:31.750 --> 15:33.340
Didn't Mu Bai already flee?

15:35.790 --> 15:36.610
So what do you think?

15:41.120 --> 15:41.890
Changhe was behind that.

15:43.270 --> 15:44.100
Mu Qingyang secretly joined

15:44.150 --> 15:45.370
Changhe's faction.

15:46.550 --> 15:47.580
And on Changhe's orders,

15:47.630 --> 15:48.370
he killed Mu Bai

15:49.870 --> 15:50.490
to frame you.

15:52.270 --> 15:53.220
That brat...

15:53.960 --> 15:54.940
He even schemes against me.

15:58.000 --> 15:59.730
He killed two young masters with one strike,

16:00.200 --> 16:01.300
seeming to cripple two families,

16:02.510 --> 16:04.460
but really dumping the blame on the Su family.

16:05.840 --> 16:07.010
This Blood River chaos

16:07.960 --> 16:08.770
has shifted

16:08.790 --> 16:10.130
from Three Families racing to kill the Patriarch

16:10.480 --> 16:11.460
and seize the Dormant Dragon Sword

16:12.030 --> 16:13.370
into a full-blown free-for-all.

16:15.320 --> 16:16.580
The greatest gains

16:17.390 --> 16:17.770
often come

16:17.840 --> 16:19.220
from the greatest chaos.

16:20.510 --> 16:21.460
Changhe's game

16:22.910 --> 16:24.060
has reached its endgame.

16:27.320 --> 16:28.770
I should've guessed

16:29.480 --> 16:30.250
he wasn't helping

16:30.270 --> 16:31.490
the Su family.

16:32.270 --> 16:33.770
He wanted the Dormant Dragon Sword himself.

16:34.480 --> 16:35.820
But even with the sword in hand,

16:35.840 --> 16:36.820
it's not over.

16:38.120 --> 16:39.300
Things were never as simple

16:39.320 --> 16:40.420
as Changhe thought.

16:44.080 --> 16:45.100
Looks like

16:45.670 --> 16:47.130
you have a plan of your own.

17:16.070 --> 17:17.940
The poison's nearly cleared.

17:19.680 --> 17:21.530
Has the young miracle physician returned?

17:37.720 --> 17:38.730
Long time no see,

17:39.790 --> 17:40.460
Sir.

17:42.510 --> 17:43.330
Zhe?

17:49.110 --> 17:50.010
Why did you

17:50.030 --> 17:51.050
suddenly show up here?

17:51.440 --> 17:53.090
Did that brat Su Jinhui

17:53.440 --> 17:54.940
send you to kill me?

18:00.200 --> 18:01.240
Years ago,

18:01.680 --> 18:03.200
I once risked my life

18:03.680 --> 18:04.860
for you.

18:06.270 --> 18:07.620
Now we meet again,

18:08.070 --> 18:08.940
Sir,

18:09.440 --> 18:10.190
you actually think

18:10.190 --> 18:11.460
I came to kill you?

18:14.790 --> 18:16.250
That stings.

18:19.200 --> 18:20.330
Isn't it so?

18:22.310 --> 18:23.090
It was, at first,

18:24.030 --> 18:25.050
but my daughter said

18:25.920 --> 18:26.660
if we took the fee,

18:27.440 --> 18:28.330
we must cure you.

18:29.160 --> 18:30.180
I listened to her.

18:32.110 --> 18:32.980
Your daughter?

18:38.790 --> 18:40.380
The Wen family of Medicine King Valley...

18:41.510 --> 18:42.700
No wonder.

18:44.240 --> 18:44.770
So,

18:45.110 --> 18:46.460
I should thank you, Sir.

18:47.200 --> 18:48.420
If not for that business with you,

18:49.000 --> 18:49.860
I'd have had no way

18:49.880 --> 18:51.180
to reunite with my girl.

19:05.200 --> 19:06.090
Miracle physician indeed.

19:09.480 --> 19:10.290
Yes.

19:10.720 --> 19:11.380
Your poison

19:11.590 --> 19:12.620
is mostly cleared.

19:13.270 --> 19:13.860
But remember:

19:14.200 --> 19:15.010
for the next few days,

19:15.310 --> 19:16.700
don't use inner force at will,

19:17.000 --> 19:18.860
or all is wasted.

19:21.030 --> 19:23.220
So you used Soul-Swap Technique

19:23.480 --> 19:24.730
to probe my memory

19:25.480 --> 19:27.610
to seek your father.

19:28.720 --> 19:30.380
And to cure your poison, too!

19:31.350 --> 19:32.770
I didn't lie to you.

19:33.480 --> 19:33.860
Look,

19:34.270 --> 19:35.250
you're back

19:35.270 --> 19:35.940
to being healthy.

19:37.310 --> 19:40.050
About the fee we agreed on,

19:40.310 --> 19:41.460
shouldn't we settle that?

19:44.120 --> 19:45.330
Everything I promised

19:45.350 --> 19:46.260
will be paid in full.

19:46.830 --> 19:48.140
I'm just curious,

19:48.880 --> 19:49.720
miracle physician,

19:50.030 --> 19:51.380
how did you cure me?

19:52.000 --> 19:53.490
I used Soul-Swap Technique

19:53.960 --> 19:56.010
to share your senses,

19:56.550 --> 19:57.980
so I also tasted

19:58.200 --> 19:59.490
that poison's agony

19:59.490 --> 20:00.770
throughout your body.

20:01.550 --> 20:02.770
But in the process,

20:03.550 --> 20:04.220
I found

20:04.750 --> 20:06.380
among the body's 720 points,

20:06.680 --> 20:07.330
one point

20:07.720 --> 20:09.900
untouched by that poison.

20:10.510 --> 20:11.730
That's the Zhiyang point.

20:12.350 --> 20:13.380
So I used a silver needle

20:13.790 --> 20:15.420
to herd the poison

20:15.750 --> 20:16.810
and drive it all

20:16.880 --> 20:17.810
into Zhiyang.

20:19.640 --> 20:21.090
Then you set one more needle

20:21.750 --> 20:23.220
to vent the toxins out?

20:25.000 --> 20:25.810
"Vented them out"?

20:26.310 --> 20:27.180
Not that simple.

20:28.240 --> 20:28.730
This poison

20:28.880 --> 20:30.810
should've been incurable.

20:31.400 --> 20:32.420
Only one way:

20:33.200 --> 20:35.090
life for life.

20:44.240 --> 20:45.860
Life for life?

20:47.400 --> 20:48.700
You need someone

20:48.790 --> 20:50.140
with superb inner force

20:50.440 --> 20:52.050
to cover Zhiyang with a palm

20:52.310 --> 20:54.140
and draw the poison out.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.860
That means

20:56.000 --> 20:57.940
taking it into himself.

20:58.640 --> 20:59.810
Then here's the question:

21:00.830 --> 21:02.010
in this Spider's Nest,

21:02.590 --> 21:04.090
who would trade a life

21:04.590 --> 21:06.090
for you, Sir?

21:19.790 --> 21:20.660
It was Kewen.

21:22.480 --> 21:23.180
I still remember

21:23.440 --> 21:25.250
the day we entered the Spider's Nest together.

21:26.070 --> 21:26.810
Back then,

21:27.240 --> 21:28.660
you could barely stand.

21:29.400 --> 21:30.570
Yet before him,

21:30.750 --> 21:32.420
you kept a steady front,

21:32.960 --> 21:35.530
never lowering your guard.

21:36.510 --> 21:37.530
But that very man

21:37.680 --> 21:38.860
before whom you refused

21:38.920 --> 21:40.530
to drop your guard,

21:41.110 --> 21:41.810
he gave up

21:42.000 --> 21:43.010
his life for you

21:43.070 --> 21:44.140
in the end.

21:45.310 --> 21:45.860
Sir,

21:46.750 --> 21:47.680
what was there

21:48.310 --> 21:49.220
between you two?

21:55.240 --> 21:56.400
Simply put,

21:56.440 --> 21:58.290
they were once brothers who shared a bond.

21:58.750 --> 21:59.680
Later one became

21:59.720 --> 22:01.490
the almighty Patriarch,

22:01.830 --> 22:02.460
the other

22:03.310 --> 22:05.770
a hunchbacked, ugly gatekeeper.

22:07.110 --> 22:08.180
That's about it.

22:14.110 --> 22:15.490
Where is he now?

22:17.830 --> 22:18.570
He's gone.

22:22.030 --> 22:22.570
Uncle Arhat,

22:23.720 --> 22:24.660
you really won't wait

22:24.720 --> 22:25.380
for the Patriarch to wake?

22:30.590 --> 22:31.490
No.

22:32.680 --> 22:33.530
Even if he wakes,

22:34.640 --> 22:36.180
there's no need to meet again.

22:38.400 --> 22:40.090
What lay between us

22:40.960 --> 22:41.900
is wiped clean

22:42.680 --> 22:44.010
from this moment.

22:48.830 --> 22:49.940
As for this Spider's Nest,

22:52.270 --> 22:53.810
handle it as you see fit.

22:56.590 --> 22:57.770
If the Patriarch is fine,

22:59.200 --> 23:00.180
then this Spider's Nest

23:02.000 --> 23:03.220
should now belong to Medicine King Valley.

23:06.720 --> 23:07.290
Very well.

23:08.720 --> 23:09.900
That young miracle physician

23:10.400 --> 23:12.090
is a fine girl.

23:15.590 --> 23:16.810
Never thought

23:16.880 --> 23:17.900
you would tease others.

23:20.110 --> 23:21.900
Only at the brink of death

23:22.510 --> 23:24.810
do people truly see themselves

23:25.590 --> 23:27.900
and win their freedom.

23:29.590 --> 23:30.220
Now,

23:31.270 --> 23:32.980
I'm no longer of Blood River,

23:34.200 --> 23:36.250
nor Mu Kewen of the Mu family,

23:37.400 --> 23:38.460
nor the keeper

23:40.270 --> 23:42.620
of this Spider's Nest.

23:48.110 --> 23:49.420
Without these burdens,

23:50.830 --> 23:51.680
I suddenly feel

23:51.720 --> 23:53.100
living in this world

23:53.960 --> 23:54.490
seems to have

23:55.400 --> 23:57.090
a bit more flavor.

23:58.550 --> 23:59.620
And I no longer

24:01.110 --> 24:02.220
wish so much to die.

24:06.110 --> 24:06.700
Uncle Arhat...

24:10.880 --> 24:11.950
I've heard

24:12.350 --> 24:13.920
your story with Su Changhe.

24:15.030 --> 24:16.380
You're much like

24:16.720 --> 24:18.330
me and Mingce in our youth.

24:20.750 --> 24:21.860
Oh, Mu Mingce

24:22.550 --> 24:25.250
was the Patriarch's name back then.

24:27.750 --> 24:28.570
I hope

24:29.400 --> 24:31.220
the ending between you two

24:31.920 --> 24:33.140
can be different

24:34.550 --> 24:35.460
from ours.

25:11.350 --> 25:11.940
He said

25:12.270 --> 25:12.860
what he owed you

25:13.070 --> 25:14.420
is paid this time.

25:15.640 --> 25:16.660
And what you owe him...

25:17.590 --> 25:18.900
leave it to the next life.

25:21.590 --> 25:23.570
For the rest of his days,

25:23.920 --> 25:24.860
he won't be Mu Kewen,

25:25.830 --> 25:26.940
nor belong to Blood River.

25:28.550 --> 25:29.380
No more meetings.

25:33.070 --> 25:34.940
He's drawn almost all the toxins

25:35.310 --> 25:36.660
from your body,

25:37.200 --> 25:38.250
but traces remain.

25:39.270 --> 25:40.860
I'll clear it with acupuncture

25:41.110 --> 25:42.180
over the next few days.

25:43.030 --> 25:43.900
But remember:

25:44.750 --> 25:45.430
for these days,

25:45.430 --> 25:46.930
do not stir your inner force,

25:47.240 --> 25:48.220
or it may return.

25:50.830 --> 25:51.420
So,

25:52.160 --> 25:53.220
does what comes next

25:53.920 --> 25:55.530
have nothing to do with us?

25:56.440 --> 25:57.660
Then please, Sir,

25:58.000 --> 25:59.290
write the Soul Reapers' Hall.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.020
I'm leaving.

26:01.590 --> 26:03.190
Tell them not to send killers after me.

26:11.200 --> 26:12.770
I gave you a chance,

26:13.960 --> 26:15.600
but you stayed.

26:16.440 --> 26:17.770
Some choices

26:19.160 --> 26:21.090
don't allow regret.

26:27.480 --> 26:28.290
Do not misuse your inner force.

26:36.880 --> 26:37.330
Uncle Zhe,

26:38.030 --> 26:39.250
let me speak with the Patriarch

26:39.310 --> 26:39.940
before we decide.

26:42.960 --> 26:43.660
You're right.

26:44.510 --> 26:45.100
Go talk first.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.260
If talk fails,

26:48.070 --> 26:49.220
I'll collect your body.

26:51.270 --> 26:52.430
Uncle Zhe, I hope

26:52.430 --> 26:53.580
you won't have to.

27:20.030 --> 27:21.070
The miracle physician

27:21.270 --> 27:22.700
has cleared my poison.

27:24.640 --> 27:25.180
Muyu,

27:26.110 --> 27:26.830
you fulfilled

27:26.830 --> 27:28.490
your own promise.

27:30.070 --> 27:31.570
I'll grant you freedom.

27:32.550 --> 27:33.140
Come here.

27:42.000 --> 27:43.820
Back then outside the Wailing Abyss,

27:44.200 --> 27:44.940
with one sword

27:44.960 --> 27:46.460
I planted the Life-Death Contract in you.

27:46.720 --> 27:47.980
The seven-year term nears.

27:48.480 --> 27:49.530
Only my inner force can dissolve it.

27:49.880 --> 27:51.490
That is our pact.

27:52.160 --> 27:52.770
Now,

27:53.830 --> 27:54.810
I'll purge it for you.

27:56.110 --> 27:56.980
No need, Sir.

27:58.200 --> 27:58.700
The poison

27:59.790 --> 28:00.980
was cured years ago.

28:03.070 --> 28:03.770
What?

28:05.440 --> 28:06.770
When I mastered the Eighteen-Sword Array,

28:07.400 --> 28:08.460
sword qi flooded my body

28:09.590 --> 28:10.570
and by chance that Life-Death Contract

28:10.590 --> 28:11.290
was dispelled.

28:17.590 --> 28:18.770
So that's it.

28:20.830 --> 28:22.020
I always thought

28:23.200 --> 28:25.290
you risked your life to guard me

28:26.550 --> 28:28.290
because of the shackle of the Life-Death Contract.

28:31.240 --> 28:32.700
You once saved my brother and me

28:32.750 --> 28:33.720
outside the Wailing Abyss.

28:34.440 --> 28:35.140
That kindness

28:35.880 --> 28:37.900
was worth my sword at your side.

28:39.030 --> 28:40.180
And the day I became a Kui,

28:41.440 --> 28:42.180
I swore with the Twelve Zodiacs

28:42.240 --> 28:43.290
an oath as well.

28:49.830 --> 28:50.770
Not by coercion,

28:52.480 --> 28:53.460
nor for profit,

28:56.920 --> 28:57.620
but for...

28:59.310 --> 29:00.900
loyalty and duty.

29:02.480 --> 29:03.220
I believe

29:04.480 --> 29:06.050
that's simply how it should be.

29:13.750 --> 29:14.380
Thank you.

29:16.720 --> 29:17.530
Just doing my duty.

29:23.510 --> 29:25.220
Don't say that again.

29:29.070 --> 29:29.730
I prefer

29:29.750 --> 29:31.660
the word earlier:

29:32.200 --> 29:32.980
loyalty.

29:37.550 --> 29:38.940
Blood River's Furnace

29:39.440 --> 29:40.900
can't teach that word.

29:42.790 --> 29:44.010
My father taught me that.

29:47.310 --> 29:49.090
The Sword God Zhuo Yuluo!

29:50.720 --> 29:52.380
He truly was remarkable.

29:55.350 --> 29:56.220
I always remember

29:57.350 --> 29:59.090
what he told me:

30:00.640 --> 30:01.770
in this world,

30:02.960 --> 30:04.530
honor bonds and keep your word.

30:07.350 --> 30:08.050
Forget either,

30:09.350 --> 30:10.980
and you lose the right to wield a sword.

30:12.400 --> 30:14.330
Honor bonds, keep your word...

30:18.590 --> 30:19.770
Just for those words,

30:22.640 --> 30:23.940
you will guard me to the death,

30:24.070 --> 30:25.330
at any cost?

30:27.030 --> 30:28.010
Some costs are off-limits.

30:29.480 --> 30:30.330
What cost?

30:32.070 --> 30:32.860
Su Changhe...

30:34.350 --> 30:35.220
he must not die.

30:53.590 --> 30:54.220
Muyu,

30:55.350 --> 30:56.380
I'm already old.

30:57.200 --> 30:59.180
Though the poison's gone,

30:59.920 --> 31:02.420
I have only a few years left.

31:06.640 --> 31:07.810
Who do you think

31:09.440 --> 31:10.530
should bear

31:10.830 --> 31:11.770
this Dormant Dragon Sword?

31:16.300 --> 31:21.260
[Qingming today; cold wind blows, grudges dissolve]

31:21.260 --> 31:25.260
[Ghost Gate opens, Yin and Yang reunite]

31:40.030 --> 31:42.290
No flowers, no wine in the Qingming rain.

31:42.590 --> 31:44.770
Blades and swords mark the road of no return.

31:52.680 --> 31:53.330
What a perfect day,

31:53.350 --> 31:54.730
just Su Muyu's kind of weather.

31:56.550 --> 31:57.730
Have you thought

31:58.070 --> 31:59.420
of a name?

32:02.920 --> 32:03.940
I want the name Su Muyu.

32:05.070 --> 32:05.530
Why?

32:07.960 --> 32:09.460
That day my family was slain,

32:11.270 --> 32:12.490
my father shielded me,

32:13.830 --> 32:15.460
set me on a floating plank,

32:16.640 --> 32:18.010
and the current carried me here.

32:19.110 --> 32:20.220
It was dusk,

32:22.030 --> 32:23.620
with a steady, gentle rain.

32:25.200 --> 32:26.490
A good name.

32:29.400 --> 32:30.050
And you?

32:31.200 --> 32:32.090
What will you be called?

32:33.880 --> 32:35.320
Two suns make "Chang",

32:37.110 --> 32:38.540
meaning prosperous,

32:39.460 --> 32:40.270
bright.

32:43.000 --> 32:44.250
So I'm...

32:46.070 --> 32:47.520
Su Changhe.

32:50.100 --> 32:56.340
♪Bound by fate, I draw my blade again♪

32:56.380 --> 32:59.180
♪Rain drifts on steel at dusk♪

32:59.300 --> 33:03.380
♪Moon ripples below, road far ahead♪

33:03.420 --> 33:10.180
♪Dust rises, I walk toward the light♪

33:10.220 --> 33:17.140
♪Even alone through storm and snow♪

33:17.300 --> 33:23.900
♪I know spring dawn waits not far ahead♪

33:24.020 --> 33:30.700
♪I know spring dawn waits not far ahead♪

33:32.860 --> 33:36.580
[Unpredictable, Untraceable]

33:39.880 --> 33:40.290
Sir.

33:40.790 --> 33:42.240
Su Muyu has passed Qinghe Street.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.510
He'll be here

33:43.590 --> 33:44.390
any minute now.

33:48.240 --> 33:49.090
He's coming alone?

33:49.830 --> 33:50.220
Yes.

33:51.790 --> 33:52.570
Looks like

33:52.640 --> 33:53.250
he found our hideout

33:53.750 --> 33:54.730
and came for us.

33:55.640 --> 33:56.490
Coming alone,

33:57.440 --> 33:58.940
he wants to negotiate.

34:00.510 --> 34:02.610
Will he negotiate,

34:04.640 --> 34:05.460
Changhe?

34:06.030 --> 34:07.050
Negotiate what?

34:08.250 --> 34:10.260
It's hard to make him say a few words.

34:10.510 --> 34:11.660
You expect him

34:11.840 --> 34:13.260
to talk deals?

34:14.020 --> 34:16.050
You can negotiate without talking.

34:16.590 --> 34:18.380
We Su folk negotiate

34:19.070 --> 34:20.130
by the sword.

34:23.460 --> 34:26.220
[Sword Qi Soars]

34:32.000 --> 34:33.130
I've waited long for you,

34:33.510 --> 34:34.570
Su Muyu!

34:35.110 --> 34:36.010
I'm here for the master.

34:38.320 --> 34:38.860
Halt!

34:41.280 --> 34:42.010
Su Muyu,

34:42.550 --> 34:44.170
let me test your sword.

34:45.320 --> 34:46.050
Su Ze

34:47.030 --> 34:48.010
facing Su Muyu?

34:56.760 --> 34:57.900
Tricks and trifles.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.050
Better use

34:59.070 --> 35:00.210
your Eighteen-Sword Array.

35:00.960 --> 35:02.010
You want to see my sword?

35:02.590 --> 35:03.420
I want to see

35:03.880 --> 35:05.380
who is the strongest swordsman

35:05.670 --> 35:07.010
of this Su generation.

35:07.320 --> 35:08.690
Why is the Su family's top swordsman

35:08.710 --> 35:09.530
one of them?

35:09.920 --> 35:11.010
Did Su Ze crown himself?

35:11.670 --> 35:12.650
You use daggers.

35:13.150 --> 35:14.090
If you take a sword,

35:14.670 --> 35:15.610
I'll look forward

35:15.670 --> 35:16.610
to that instant

35:17.110 --> 35:17.860
you draw,

35:18.480 --> 35:19.940
to your blade's light.

35:21.550 --> 35:22.130
Let's make a bet.

35:23.070 --> 35:24.650
How many moves before Su Ze's down?

35:25.670 --> 35:26.940
Ze is still too young.

35:28.670 --> 35:30.340
Within five moves, I'd say.

35:36.460 --> 35:39.940
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:39.980 --> 35:43.860
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:45.700 --> 35:49.180
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

35:49.220 --> 35:53.060
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

35:55.060 --> 35:58.340
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

35:58.460 --> 36:00.540
♪Still I can't let go♪

36:00.700 --> 36:04.140
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

36:04.620 --> 36:06.820
♪My heart no longer my own♪

36:06.940 --> 36:11.940
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:28.540 --> 36:32.260
♪How many hidden feelings♪

36:32.380 --> 36:36.460
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:37.700 --> 36:41.580
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:41.700 --> 36:45.940
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

36:47.060 --> 36:49.940
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

36:50.020 --> 36:54.260
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

36:56.540 --> 37:00.540
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

37:00.580 --> 37:04.020
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

37:05.540 --> 37:08.980
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

37:09.060 --> 37:12.860
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

37:14.780 --> 37:18.220
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

37:18.260 --> 37:22.100
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

37:24.140 --> 37:27.380
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

37:27.500 --> 37:29.580
♪Still I can't let go♪

37:29.780 --> 37:33.180
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

37:33.660 --> 37:35.860
♪My heart no longer my own♪

37:35.940 --> 37:40.980
♪No one can escape from love♪

37:48.340 --> 37:50.540
♪My heart no longer my own♪

37:50.620 --> 37:55.660
♪No one can escape from love♪
